The first slice on the machine's GPU: the program of omp-target-two-nodes.m,
compiled by the driver for it, with node 1's target region running there
and exchanging integers with node 2's main, another process, over TCP.
REQUIRES: amdgpu-gpu

RUN: merkc -fopenmp --offload-arch=%offload-arch %libomp-flags %S/omp-target-two-nodes.m -o %t
RUN: %libomp-env OMP_TARGET_OFFLOAD=MANDATORY %python %S/Inputs/two-nodes.py %t first-slice \
RUN:   | FileCheck %S/omp-target-two-nodes.m --check-prefix=OUTPUT --match-full-lines --strict-whitespace
